<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45626" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφέδρ-α</span></b> , Ion, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέδρη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sitting by</i> or <i>before</i> a place:
			hence, <i>siege, blockade</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέδρην ποιήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.65
				</span></i>
			; <i>observation</i> of a besieged place, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				18.14
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sitting upon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				288a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phleg.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>base</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>surface</i> of a threshold, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Phil.</u>
				44.249
			</span></i> (Didyma, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a plant, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππουρις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				26.36
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.46
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
